1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,090
In 2022, a glacial lake flood destroyed a highway bridge.

2
00:00:04,330 --> 00:00:07,310
This July, cloud hid these lakes for weeks.

3
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:11,150
NASA and ISRO's NISAR radar sees through it.

4
00:00:11,690 --> 00:00:13,347
So we built SARtale:

5
00:00:13,387 --> 00:00:15,370
one status for each lake.

6
00:00:15,910 --> 00:00:17,730
Each pass maps the water,

7
00:00:18,170 --> 00:00:20,410
against the lake's own normal range.

8
00:00:20,850 --> 00:00:23,220
It also says when a flag needs checking.

9
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:25,110
Anyone can add a lake.

10
00:00:25,550 --> 00:00:28,620
When clouds close in, the lakes stay in view.
